        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Anna Camp, Maggie Kiley, Samuel Page, Stefanie Scott, Amelia Rose Blaire\n- Films: Pitch Perfect, Pitch Perfect 2, Pitch Perfect 3, Caught\n- Fictional Organizations: The Bellas\n- Places: Barden University\n- Roles: Aubrey Posen\n\nFacts:\n- In 2012, Anna Camp played Aubrey Posen in the film \"Pitch Perfect.\"\n- In 2015, Anna Camp reprised Aubrey Posen in the film \"Pitch Perfect 2.\"\n- In 2015, \"Pitch Perfect 2\" centered on the fictional Barden University and The Bellas, an all-female a cappella singing group.\n- In 2015, \"Caught\" was released as an American psychological thriller film directed by Maggie Kiley and starring Anna Camp, Samuel Page, Stefanie Scott, and Amelia Rose Blaire.\n- In 2017, Anna Camp was identified as appearing as Aubrey Posen in the upcoming film \"Pitch Perfect 3.\"",
